      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "约、约会就是那个呗……就是，那个……\n彼此互相喜欢的两个人……单、单独两人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d16104dae7d946cd7c4632214fd586adf215eae27f43d8a559f8f3be552fa6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
