    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee34837b7438c4ed4d1da2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "雪之美人看起来非常沮丧。\n她刚刚说“对我来说还太早”，这句话让我很介意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e05666b3c2decbd5f68beea4c28781fba5539e5d04b8810249f88f9bf4150b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
